Supported machines are:
an5206               Arnewsh 5206
mcf5208evb           MCF5208EVB (default)
next-cube            NeXT Cube
none                 empty machine
q800                 Macintosh Quadra 800
virt-10.0            QEMU 10.0 M68K Virtual Machine
virt-10.1            QEMU 10.1 M68K Virtual Machine
virt-10.2            QEMU 10.2 M68K Virtual Machine
virt-11.0            QEMU 11.0 M68K Virtual Machine
virt-11.1            QEMU 11.1 M68K Virtual Machine
virt                 QEMU 11.2 M68K Virtual Machine (alias of virt-11.2)
virt-11.2            QEMU 11.2 M68K Virtual Machine
virt-6.0             QEMU 6.0 M68K Virtual Machine (deprecated)
virt-6.1             QEMU 6.1 M68K Virtual Machine (deprecated)
virt-6.2             QEMU 6.2 M68K Virtual Machine (deprecated)
virt-7.0             QEMU 7.0 M68K Virtual Machine (deprecated)
